  "id": "evaluation-research",
  "term": "evaluation research",
  "definition": "Evaluation research is the study of whether and how change occurs in applied settings such as clinical care, psychotherapy, education, or organizations. In this source, it is described as needing methods that track change as an ongoing, phase-structured process over time rather than treating it as a simple before-and-after event.",
